{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_90_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_90","textTraditional":"一、二十有七年，春，杞子來朝。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_90_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_90","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，庚寅，齊侯昭卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_90_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_90","textTraditional":"三、秋，八月，乙未，葬齊孝公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_90_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_90","textTraditional":"四、乙巳，公子遂帥師入杞。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_90_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_90","textTraditional":"五、冬，楚人、陳侯、蔡侯、鄭伯、許男圍宋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_90_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_90","textTraditional":"楚人者，楚子也。其曰人何也？人楚子，所以人諸侯也。其人諸侯何也？不正其信夷狄而伐中國也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_90_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_90","textTraditional":"六、十有二月，甲戌，公會諸侯，盟於宋。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}